{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Spanier–Whitehead 对偶"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Spanier–Whitehead对偶"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>通过 $\\mathsf{Ani}$ 的泛性质</h3>\n<p><strong>定义</strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"LurieHA","text":"HA"}},{"Plain":" 6.3.3.2). 由于范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Sp","text":"$\\mathsf{Sp}^{\\mathrm{op}}$"}},{"Plain":" 余完备, 存在唯一的函子 $F\\colon \\mathsf{Ani} \\to \\mathsf{Sp}^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 满足 $F(*) = \\mathbb S$ ("},{"Local":{"url":"球谱","text":"球谱"}},{"Plain":"). 此时称 $F(X)$ 为 $X$ 的 <strong>Spanier–Whitehead 对偶</strong>.</p>\n"}]}}